{
    "tag": "Main Page",
    "description": "Main page constructor API. Returns the sections configured by the admin in their defined order. Sections may consist of sliders, banners, product blocks, show_on_main_page categories, show_on_main_page services, and dynamic blocks based on menu type.",
    "basePathNote": "This endpoint works under the /v1 prefix inside a route group. The endpoint is public. Language selection is handled through the Content-Language header. Sections in the response are returned according to the sort_order defined in the admin panel.",
